WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:12.304
-The bite is a gift.
-I don't want it.

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:17.726
Naked.

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:20.020
I'm so not buying your
threats anymore.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.313
Oh my god, okay.

00:00:21.897 --> 00:00:24.316
What the hell, the Stiles.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:33.325
How about you tell me
everything.

00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:35.786
It's my house,
my rules, buddy.

00:00:55.973 --> 00:00:57.349
Please, where'd it go?

00:00:57.933 --> 00:00:59.852
I thought you were psychic.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:02.229
Well, dad, there's a
conversation we--

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:03.355
You're not gay.

00:01:03.438 --> 00:01:04.731
No Stiles.

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:06.358
-What, no Stiles?
-No Stiles!

00:01:18.453 --> 00:01:21.373
No lacrosse, no popularity,
no girlfriend.

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:29.798
Is there a reason the gun
is still pointed at me?

00:01:34.303 --> 00:01:36.388
Become an alpha
by killing one.

00:01:36.471 --> 00:01:39.391
Keep your dirty little hands
to your dirty little selves.

00:01:47.274 --> 00:01:48.400
A banshee.

00:02:14.051 --> 00:02:15.427
You didn't hear that?

00:02:15.511 --> 00:02:17.471
I have no idea why that
would be in your loft.

00:02:21.517 --> 00:02:23.268
You sound just like a cop.

00:02:30.526 --> 00:02:33.445
I'm a thousand years old,
you can't kill me.

00:02:39.535 --> 00:02:42.454
Someone ask her if
she's ever played lacrosse.

00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:47.251
You're gonna be good
at this.

00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:48.460
Are you kidding?

00:02:49.545 --> 00:02:51.463
Okay,
that's kind of terrifying.

00:02:59.596 --> 00:03:00.472
Drop it!

00:03:00.556 --> 00:03:02.099
I heard you almost
got killed.

00:03:02.182 --> 00:03:03.475
I hear you almost
got killed.

00:03:03.559 --> 00:03:04.977
For our first real date...

00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:06.478
it's a start.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.650
You don't remember me,
do you?

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:15.487
You're a werewolf.

00:03:21.577 --> 00:03:23.245
He almost killed you too.

00:03:23.328 --> 00:03:24.496
And we're both
still alive, see.

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:26.582
I'm having an asthma attack.

00:03:26.665 --> 00:03:27.499
Someone?

00:03:33.589 --> 00:03:34.840
Our hands are a little
bloody sometimes.

00:03:34.923 --> 00:03:36.508
Some of us are human.

00:03:37.968 --> 00:03:39.094
What the hell was that?

00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:49.563
We've got a theory.

00:03:49.646 --> 00:03:51.440
Just a slightly
terrifying theory.

00:03:54.526 --> 00:03:55.360
I'm not done with her yet.

00:03:58.447 --> 00:03:59.948
You said you could help him.

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:06.455
Guarantee your place
as an alpha.

00:04:09.541 --> 00:04:10.834
Why don't you tell me
your name?

00:04:12.544 --> 00:04:15.464
-Will you forget me?
-I won't.

00:04:15.547 --> 00:04:17.883
-Kidnapper.
-I'm not a kidnapper.

00:04:21.553 --> 00:04:24.473
You and I are doomed
to ride the storm forever.

00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:27.476
-So if I screw up--
-You'll kill me.

00:04:28.268 --> 00:04:29.811
Mr. Rider?

00:04:30.562 --> 00:04:33.482
The plan is to get Stiles to
come up with a plan.

00:04:37.069 --> 00:04:38.403
-A Stiles?
-A what?

00:04:41.657 --> 00:04:42.491
I'm going to be fine.

00:04:43.242 --> 00:04:45.494
-He's a hellhound.
-A dead hellhound.

00:04:47.079 --> 00:04:48.497
He's been a step ahead of us
the whole time.

00:04:49.206 --> 00:04:51.500
I turn into a monster
with claws and fangs.

00:04:52.209 --> 00:04:54.503
All you have to do
is bring them out.

00:05:05.305 --> 00:05:06.515
Who wants me?

00:05:08.684 --> 00:05:09.518
My back.

